>I can't get into shops to buy and sell equipment.  So, how can I get visible
>again?
>
>BTW The wand wasn't cursed before you say that's the problem.  I've prayed a
>couple of times, but while giving me good results, I'm still invisible :-(
>-- 

You can't really get rid of it (aside from having gremlin steal it -- not
too likely).  You can get into shops though.  There are several ways for
an invisble person to get into and out of a shop, without annoying the
shopkeeper:

 - Get teleport control (ring or eat a tengu), teleport in, buy stuff, 
   teleport out.
 - Go to the door, put on jumping boots, and jump past the
   store keeper, buy stuff, jump back out.
 - Wish for blessed figurine of an Archon, apply it, and let your new
   pet Archon kill the shop keeper.  Then take all his money and 
   everything in the shop. (Alternatively, use a scroll of taming on
   any really nasty monster).
 - If you had just a pick axe, and 1 scroll of teleportation, you could
   do it: Go up to the previous level, dig a hole through the floor, and
   go through.  Keep going back up to the previous level until you land
   in the shop.  Then buy what you want and teleport out.  (kind of time
   consuming, but it works)

I personally try not to become permanantly invisible until I've been 
through the shops in the Gnomish mines.  If I find a shop when I am
permanantly invisible, and I have no way to get in, I just go on to
the next level.  Eventually, I'll find something that'll help get in,
then I'll return.
